Day 5 - Final Project: Task Manager App

This Flutter app is a final project for Internal Internship Week II.

Project idea:
A simple Task Manager App where users can add, view, complete and delete tasks.

MVP features:
- Add new task
- Show task list
- Mark task as done
- Delete task
- Show task details screen

Used concepts from Day 1-4:
- Flutter UI widgets
- TextField and controller
- StatefulWidget and setState
- ListView
- Navigator.push and Navigator.pop
- SnackBar feedback
- Model class

What can be added later:
- API connection
- Login system
- Cloudflare D1 database
- Better design

Commit message:
day5 final project
